# Stranglethorn Vale, Alliance ~36 to ~38: the second half of the consensus
# Stranglethorn visit (34.2-37.8). Flow: Kurzen's Compound (Special Forces)
# > the jungle ruins and Lake Nazferiti (Shadowmaw panthers, Venture Co.
# crystals, the four troll legends, the Green Hills pages) > Rebel Camp and
# Nesingwary turn-ins > Skullsplitter fetishes > hearth to Booty Bay (Water
# Elementals). Then on to the Swamp of Sorrows (06-arathi-highlands).
#
# Deviations: none in the quest set. Favor for Krazek (627) and Magical
# Analysis (602) are carried on: the ore drops in Arathi, the analysis is
# turned in at Dalaran's camp in Alterac (next guide).
guide forever/alliance/30-40/05-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale
faction Alliance
levels 36-38
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/alliance/30-40/06-arathi-highlands

step Kurzen's Compound
  tip Headshrinkers stand deeper in the compound; the Commandos lurk stealthed around it and in the cave. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop.
  kill 941 quest 574.1                -- Kurzen Headshrinker
  kill 938 quest 574.2                -- Kurzen Commando

step The jungle ruins
  tip Loop through the troll ruins of the north and centre: each holds one stone tablet of the troll legends. Shadowmaw Panthers prowl stealthed in the jungle around them; the Venture Co. camp on Lake Nazferiti carries the Tumbled Crystals.
  complete 207                        -- Kurzen's Mystery: four troll legends
  kill 684 quest 192                  -- Shadowmaw Panther
  collect 4106 quest 213              -- Tumbled Crystal
  complete 339                        -- Chapter I
  complete 340                        -- Chapter II
  complete 341                        -- Chapter III
  complete 342                        -- Chapter IV

step Rebel Camp
  turnin 574                          -- Lieutenant Doren
  accept 210                          -- Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay
  turnin 207                          -- Brother Nimetz
  accept 205

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 339                          -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 340
  turnin 341
  turnin 342
  turnin 338
  turnin 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin

step Skullsplitter trolls
  tip The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins east of the road between Nesingwary and Grom'gol.
  collect 2466 quest 205              -- Skullsplitter Fetish

step Brother Nimetz
  turnin 205

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Booty Bay
  hearth "Booty Bay"
  turnin 578                          -- Baron Revilgaz
  accept 601
  turnin 213                          -- Kebok
  turnin 210                          -- Krazek
  accept 627                          -- The ore drops from Drywhisker kobolds in Arathi Highlands

step Water Elementals
  collect 3923 quest 601              -- Water Elemental Bracers

step Baron Revilgaz
  turnin 601
  accept 602                          -- For Archmage Ansirem in Alterac Mountains
